- explicit tab order: instructions -> editor -> Add -> Cancel;
- Add validates before closing; invalid input keeps the dialog and pasted text open and returns focus to the editor;
- accessible instructions describe keyboard behavior;
- parser semantics remain unchanged.

No deck persistence, MainForm, profile, audio, learning scoring or canonical direct mutation.

